MACAPK_RES_OVERRIDES: a dimen value the host product chooses over the APK's, by name

"dimen/<name>=<value>;..." replaces the value a resource table row loads for
that dimen, in every configuration, so every reader (Resources.getDimension*,
TypedArray through a @dimen reference) sees it. Instamac uses it for
dimen/igds_chip_radius=8dp: Instagram 455 declares 99dp (pill-shaped chips),
while the owner's phone shows the same chips as rounded rectangles.

diff --git a/runtime/java/com/macapk/loader/ResourceIndex.java b/runtime/java/com/macapk/loader/ResourceIndex.java
--- a/runtime/java/com/macapk/loader/ResourceIndex.java
